ForwardModule_Execute
├── when recipient is zero address
│   ├── it should return success false with "Zero recipient address"
│   ├── it should return zero amountOut and empty data
│   └── it should return input token as outputToken
├── when amount is below minimum
│   └── it should return failed result with "Amount below minimum"
├── when caller has insufficient balance
│   └── it should return failed result with "Insufficient balance"
├── when transfer returns false
│   └── it should return failed result with "Transfer failed"
├── when transfer reverts
│   └── it should return failed result with "Transfer failed"
├── when multiple validations fail
│   └── it should return the first failing validation
└── when all validations pass
    ├── it should transfer tokens from caller to recipient
    ├── it should return success true with empty failureReason
    ├── it should return amountOut equal to amount
    ├── it should return outputToken equal to input token
    ├── it should return encoded recipient in data field
    ├── it should succeed when amount equals minimum
    ├── it should succeed with zero minAmount
    ├── when no-return token (e.g. USDT)
    │   └── it should transfer successfully despite missing return value
    ├── when fee-on-transfer token
    │   └── it should report amountOut equal to input amount
    └── it should handle any valid amount and minAmount [fuzz]
